=== Twisty Passage ===
You are in a maze of twisty little passages, all alike.
A brass lantern is here.
Exits: north and east.
> take lantern
Taken.
You are carrying a brass lantern.
> go east
You go east.
=== Dead End ===
Scratched into the stone: TAKE THE KEY.
A brass key is here.
Exits: west.
> take key
> go west
You go west.
> go north
You go north.
A heavy brass door is here.
Exits: south and down.
> go down
The brass door is closed.
> open door
A heavy brass door swings open.
You go down.
It is pitch dark. You are likely to be eaten by a grue.
> light lantern
A brass lantern glows warmly.
> look
=== The Vault ===
A small round chamber glittering with mica.
Exits: up.
Turn 9.
Only a builder sees the bones.
I don't know how to xyzzy.
